description	"The Shocktrooper

A heavier and more specialized variant of the Elite Trooper, the Shocktrooper is equipped with a DLT-19 heavy repeating blaster, which features an extremely high rate of fire, but poor accuracy unless fired in bursts. It also comes equipped with frag grenades to flush enemies out of cover and kinetic resistant armor.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Repeating Blaster (EE-4 2)
-- 15% Slower Movement
-- Mag Reload
- 2 Frag Grenades

^8Attributes:
- Blast Armour
- Heal (1)
- 1 Reinforcement (CTF: 17.5s Respawn)

^3Abilities:
- Quick Throw (1) ^3[CS3]

^2Strengths^7: Devestating at medium range.
^1Weaknesses^7: Relatively limited numbers, poor speed and inaccurate long range supressive fire."